### Problem
`hal_spi_acquire()` may fail to acquire mutex and when the caller doesn't check the result, it may corrupt stack.

### Solution
Use `os_mutex_recursive_lock()` in `hal_spi_acquire()` when timeout is not specified or is non-zero.

