### Problem

RTL872x-based platforms cannot preserve variables that is marked as "retained" when pin reset happens.

### Solution

1. Periodically backup the SRAM in background every 10s
2. Expose a wiring API to allow user manually backup the SRAM when necessary `System.backupRamSync()`

### Example App

```c
#include "application.h"

SYSTEM_MODE(MANUAL);

Serial1LogHandler l(115200, LOG_LEVEL_ALL);

retained uint32_t magick = 0xdeadbeef;

void setup() {
    Log.info("magick: %08X", magick);
}

void loop() {
    magick++;
    delay(10s);
    // System.backupRamSync(); // call manually, or it will automatically be called every 10s by the system
}
```

