### Problem

This PR adds initial support for CoAP blockwise transfers (see [RFC 7959](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc7959)) that allow sending large CoAP requests and responses that would not normally fit into a single UDP packet. For now, blockwise transfer is only implemented for Describe messages.

