The initialization order between the translation units is undefined, so the inline static variable which gets a reference to the pin map from the HAL can be initialized at any point in time during traversal of the global ctor list, making it impossible to use fastpin functions within global constructors e.g. `STARTUP()` in a different translation unit that uses a function to call fastpin.

