### Problem

Cellular modem is not completely turned off when device is going into sleep mode.

### Solution

Wait until the Cellular modem is turned off reliably before device entering sleep mode.

### Example App

```c
#include "Particle.h"

SYSTEM_MODE(MANUAL);

SYSTEM_THREAD(ENABLED);

Serial1LogHandler log(115200, LOG_LEVEL_ALL);

void setup() {
    pinMode(A1, INPUT_PULLUP);

    Cellular.on();
}

void loop() {
    if (digitalRead(A1) == 0) {
        LOG(TRACE, "Device is going to enter sleep mode.");
        SystemSleepConfiguration config;
        config.mode(SystemSleepMode::HIBERNATE).gpio(A0, RISING);
        System.sleep(config);

        Cellular.on();
    }
}
```

