### Problem

We'd like to store full 15-digit serial numbers when manufacturing Gen 2 devices in the OTP area, ideally using the same format used on Gen 3 devices. This requires support on the DeviceOS side as well.

### Solution

Implement `FLASH_ReadOTP()` and `FLASH_WriteOTP()` to read and write OTP on Gen 2 devices.

### Steps to Test
1. Compile and download below application
2. Observe the serial log, it will print serial number, mobile secret, and NCP ID


### Example App

```c
