- [Info on Strict Aliasing Rule](http://stackoverflow.com/questions/98650/what-is-the-strict-aliasing-rule) Can be very bad, typically best to avoid.
- Implementation of Equals operators were moved from header file to source file.
- Implementation of Equals operators were changed to prevent [type-punning](http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Type_punning).
- Changed implementation of Copy operator, Equals operator and Constructor for uint32_t types due to endianness of octet vs. array with memcpy and memcmp do not work as desired.
- Moved comment for raw_address() method to the correct location.
- Slight style tweak for pointers.
